<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>操作系统 - 标签 - 半生戎码</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/tags/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/</link><description>半生戎码 - Jeff 的技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.170.1 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-rc.5</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</managingEditor><webMaster>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 08 Feb 2023 22:59:45 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luzhifang.github.io/tags/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>IO</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-io/</link><pubDate>Wed, 06 Jun 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-io/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/">操作系统</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="计算机-io"&gt;&lt;span&gt;计算机 IO&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%ae%a1%e7%ae%97%e6%9c%ba-io" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;IO，英文全称是 Input/Output，翻译过来就是输入/输出。比如磁盘 IO，网络 IO。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>进程线程协程的区别</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/process-thread-coroutine/</link><pubDate>Wed, 06 Jun 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/process-thread-coroutine/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/">操作系统</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="进程与线程的区别"&gt;&lt;span&gt;进程与线程的区别&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%bf%9b%e7%a8%8b%e4%b8%8e%e7%ba%bf%e7%a8%8b%e7%9a%84%e5%8c%ba%e5%88%ab" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;每个线程都是一个轻量级进程(Light Weight Process)，都有自己的唯一 PID 和一个 TGID(Thread group ID)。TGID 是启动整个进程的 thread 的 PID。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>文件系统</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-file-system/</link><pubDate>Tue, 05 Jun 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-file-system/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/">操作系统</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="文件系统"&gt;&lt;span&gt;文件系统&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e6%96%87%e4%bb%b6%e7%b3%bb%e7%bb%9f" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;操作系统为磁盘提供的抽象就是：文件及文件系统，或者说，文件系统就是磁盘的抽象。当然文件系统不一定在磁盘上，也可以在光盘上。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>磁盘</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-disk/</link><pubDate>Mon, 04 Jun 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-disk/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/">操作系统</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="磁盘的物理结构"&gt;&lt;span&gt;磁盘的物理结构&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e7%a3%81%e7%9b%98%e7%9a%84%e7%89%a9%e7%90%86%e7%bb%93%e6%9e%84" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;硬盘内部主要部件为磁盘盘片、传动手臂、读写磁头和主轴马达。实际数据都是写在盘片上，读写主要是通过传动手臂上的读写磁头来完成。实际运行时，主轴让磁盘盘片转动，然后传动手臂可伸展让读取头在盘片上进行读写操作。磁盘物理结构如下图所示：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>内存</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-memory/</link><pubDate>Sun, 03 Jun 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-memory/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/">操作系统</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="内存简介"&gt;&lt;span&gt;内存简介&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%86%85%e5%ad%98%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;内存架构：缓存 -&amp;gt; 主存 -&amp;gt; 磁盘 -&amp;gt; 磁带&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>线程</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-thread/</link><pubDate>Sat, 02 Jun 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-thread/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/">操作系统</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="线程简介"&gt;&lt;span&gt;线程简介&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e7%ba%bf%e7%a8%8b%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;一个程序只有一个执行点（一个程序计数器，用来存放要执行的指令），但多线程（multi-threaded）程序会有多个执行点（多个程序计数器，每个都用于取指令和执行）。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>进程</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-process/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Jun 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/os-process/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/">操作系统</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="进程简介"&gt;&lt;span&gt;进程简介&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%bf%9b%e7%a8%8b%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;进程就是运行中的程序。操作系统运行程序必须做的第一件事是将代码和所有静态数据（例如初始化变量）加载（load）到内存中，加载到进程的地址空间中。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>